alacritty_terminal 0.26.0 as published, with the change Mu needs to name terminal tabs as shells
ask:

- The icon name a program sets (vte's `set_icon_name`, from Mu's vte patch) is passed on as
  `Event::IconName`, as the window title is as `Event::Title`.

